# ==============================================================================
# Description: Line-ending hygiene so sh/* stay LF (Linux runners) and bat/*
#   stay CRLF (Windows Jenkins agent + GeneXus MSBuild).
# Maintainer: pipeline-quality (openspec pipeline-hardening-trazabilidad)
# Usage: automatic via git checkout/commit; verify with 'git ls-files --eol'.
# Env Vars: none. Dependencies: git.
# ==============================================================================
# Shell wrappers run on Linux: force LF even on Windows checkouts.
sh/*.sh text eol=lf
# Batch wrappers run on the Windows Jenkins agent: force CRLF.
bat/*.bat text eol=crlf
# Compose/Dockerfile/Jenkinsfile: LF everywhere for reproducible parsing.
Jenkinsfile text eol=lf
docker/* text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
